      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "L'Éclat offers a wonderfully intimate dining escape, characterized by its dim lighting and warm, woody ambiance. The star of the evening was the duck confit; its wonderfully crisp skin gave way to incredibly tender meat, though the accompanying sauce leaned slightly toward the salty side. While the staff provided genuinely friendly service, pacing in the wine selection felt a little leisurely. This charming bistro is a truly delightful choice for a romantic evening, provided you have time to savor every moment.",
